# The Array Root (CIPlay array_root): 35 m down; the pylon ring, the crew notice, chamber 1, the anglers in the kelp,
# pylon A, chamber 2, pylon B, the Root's guardian (a giant angler, in the pit), the root cutoff (the pylons burst), the
# root vault, Halvard's apology, the buoy on the surface.
island The Array Root
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Root
zone pylon_ring
expect step 1
read Root crew notice
expect step 2
air dome_1
expect step 3
zone root_anglers
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
use rootcutoff
expect story rootoff 0
use pylona
expect story pylonaoff 1
expect step 5
air dome_2
expect step 6
use pylonb
expect story pylonboff 1
expect step 7
zone root_pit
kill Angler fish
expect story rootguard 1
expect step 8
use rootcutoff
expect story rootoff 1
expect hidden pylons
expect shown pylonsburst
expect step 9
open Root vault
wait 3
expect step 10
read Halvard's apology
expect step 11
zone surface_buoy
expect done
